sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin Operator
    participant UI as Admin Chat Drawer
    participant Server as Express (/api/admin/ai/ask)
    participant Graph as LangGraph StateGraph
    participant Agent as Agent Node (ChatGoogleGenerativeAI)
    participant Tools as ToolNode (billingTools)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    Admin->>UI: Types query ("Show me all unpaid bills")
    UI->>Server: POST /api/admin/ai/ask { message, history }
    Server->>Graph: graph.invoke({ messages }, { recursionLimit: 10 })
    Graph->>Agent: callModel(state) with SystemMessage
    Agent->>Graph: AIMessage with tool_calls (get_unpaid_bills)
    Graph->>Tools: toolsCondition routes to ToolNode
    Tools->>DB: Execute getUnpaidBills({ limit })
    DB-->>Tools: Database Result Rows
    Tools-->>Graph: ToolMessage with stringified JSON result
    Graph->>Agent: Loop back to Agent Node with tool results
    Agent->>Graph: Final AIMessage (no tool_calls)
    Graph-->>Server: Final State (toolsCondition routes to END)
    Server-->>UI: 200 OK { reply, toolsUsed: ['get_unpaid_bills'] }
    UI-->>Admin: Displays formatted response with tool badge
